{"id":"280e7f496839f2d8","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Cofinal Sequence In Product","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product — ZFC Pcf2 Cofinal Sequence In Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product — ZFC Pcf2 Cofinal Sequence In Product","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product — ZFC Pcf2 Cofinal Sequence In Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\vec f,\\alpha,f,g,a\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\vec f,\\alpha,f,g,a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (auxiliary predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(f,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,\\bigcup A)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(f,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,\\bigcup A)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(f,g,A,J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(f,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(g,A)\n\\land\\{a\\in A:f(a)\\notin g(a)\\}\\in J\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(f,g,A,J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(f,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(g,A)\n\\land\\{a\\in A:f(a)\\notin g(a)\\}\\in J\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S(A,J,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\n\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),\\mathcal P(A\\times\\bigcup A))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),A)\n\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(g,A)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(g,\\vec f(\\alpha),A,J)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S(A,J,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\n\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),\\mathcal P(A\\times\\bigcup A))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),A)\n\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PcfProductMember}_S(g,A)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(g,\\vec f(\\alpha),A,J)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reduced-product carrier and the strict order modulo the proper ideal are defined explicitly.</li>\n<li>This predicate records a cofinal ordinal-indexed enumeration; monotonicity is added by the cofinal-chain atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md"